  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_8e167aca7acb4ff5b130e02ddeae3217",
      "statement": "The ulabase setup pipeline is a `defineSetup` export of ordered `step` objects, each with a `check` (is the service already in the desired state?) and an `apply` (make it so); `--dry-run` runs only the checks and reports what is missing, and re-running against an already-configured service writes nothing because every check reflects the state its apply produces.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.ts#L1-L33",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b1fa8b0697d9421f056dd4c771a7d6c2cf87747359933e8fefa93a3f33d3b921:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.ts#L111-L231",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:73aac704fdbc17818a40cda5f9e56a5b2e535850275b90abc34b1db781086441:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e87c4de663a84b8dae2a8a9988913ac5",
      "statement": "The accounts setup (`ulabase.setup.ts`) runs its steps in a fixed order — accounts feature install, branding name, accounts config, conditional Google OAuth credentials, origin-allowlist — and places `appPointsAtService` last on purpose, so a setup that stops halfway leaves the app on the connect-your-service screen rather than a sign-up page that fails against a half-configured backend.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.ts#L111-L231",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:73aac704fdbc17818a40cda5f9e56a5b2e535850275b90abc34b1db781086441:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_807da2fdc7d14c0a89c08372031e8e71",
      "statement": "`appPointsAtService` compares and rewrites only the `apiUrl: '...'` line of `src/environments/environment.dev.ts` to the URL from `admin.serviceToken(srvId)`, leaving comments and feature flags untouched; it is exported so extending setups can keep it last.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.ts#L229-L231",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:61f2feb1250904ceee1d659b9ec9d272ebdf832325938f77b8b88b57b307e0d6:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.ts#L79-L110",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a6b9e5432fb66e39fd668ddd0fdb9e328642afa234163c9a24b554394aa71dc5:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_34cfe47956314402ae58dcf8470d2689",
      "statement": "The accounts feature install step treats HTTP `409 Plugin already installed` as success: the desired state is that the feature exists, so failing on 409 would report a problem that does not exist on a forced apply or re-run.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.ts#L111-L116",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:218ffd4fc646ea70c8baedf96d5f8e396ac9f1de23e68ee76f2c67b70b01e65b:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.ts#L63-L77",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:76936a9bc6179ecc27a6d9e4acb6f4dffb420c0510fa25780486a0aef4cfe0d3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_de9fdddb819e4cebb690256574c8b376",
      "statement": "The branding step writes `APP_NAME` (from env, default `Ulabase Starter`) into the `branding` feature's `name` via a read-modify-write that spreads the current config first, so console-set color and logo are preserved rather than replaced by an update that overwrites the whole document.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.ts#L118-L132",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:53cc8dd09958f524ead87ceaaf549188985edead5626bb6c6eb86042a19e8862:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.ts#L36-L39",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:755d39a5e249d7da3f73c5f9e52cb644d063d11b356fa2694ce41ec47dd95a54:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b994e0e018b04d19ac4179f017e63d29",
      "statement": "The server's Sign-up Mgmt feature toggles are derived from the same `environment.features` the app imports (`src/environments/environment.dev.ts`): `emailRegistration` maps to both `registration` and `verification`, `passwordReset` to `password-reset`, `teamInvitations` to `invitations`, and `oauthLogin` to `oauth`, so the flags are stated once and cannot drift between app and service.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/environments/environment.dev.ts#L8-L18",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6e50384986af33d7acf8eba8590180ec485097c71e15d5d343d12af7c69e6b06:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.ts#L45-L61",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7911ec86374fe78a6738af5c67b5386e545bdf9d04b8afc060d9f8c70d70d2dc:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_df41f1f75e3849b8b8e5336b74a11693",
      "statement": "The accounts config step sets `frontend-url` and `frontend-app-url` to `APP_URL` (env, default `http://localhost:4200`) and merges the derived feature toggles into the accounts config; those URLs are where verification, reset, and invitation email links point and where a verified or signed-in user lands.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.ts#L133-L160",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:535707b0770f3b56155ae57839019629d84b470dac0c514135a5165bdf014e95:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.ts#L36-L37",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e8d36b7c325efd0c25541de81d10b45c7e5dd3d6e5d19068c04770b7eb2597e3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9d7f49813240430fa281e92039512d72",
      "statement": "Secret fields read back from the admin API as redaction bullets (`isRedacted`) when stored and blank when never set; the accounts config apply passes redaction placeholders straight back in its read-modify-write so the server restores stored values instead of the setup writing bullets over a real secret.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.ts#L133-L160",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:535707b0770f3b56155ae57839019629d84b470dac0c514135a5165bdf014e95:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://ulabase.setup.ts#L41-L47",
